SUMMARY:Councillor Fletcher's Dieppe Park Environment Day
DESCRIPTION:Join Councillor Paula Fletcher on Saturday\, May 23rd for her 2026 Dieppe Park Environment Day! \nIt takes place from 10 a.m. to 2 p.m. (rain or shine). \nPick up:\n– Free loose compost*\n– Kitchen containers for organics (available for purchase) \nFree paper shredding services will also be available\, with each household limited to two bags of paper for shredding. \n*Please bring a shovel and container as compost will not be bagged. Compost will be available on a first come\, first served basis and delivered rain or shine. \nDrop off for recycling or proper disposal:\n– Electronic waste\n– Household hazardous waste \nYou can also donate a number of household items for reuse. \nVisit paulafletcher.ca/dieppe_park_environment_day_2026 to learn more.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/councillor-fletchers-dieppe-park-environment-day/
LOCATION:Dieppe Park\, 455 Cosburn Ave\, East York\, M4J 2N2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/22160722/Dieppe-Enviro-Day-2026_IGformat_V1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="City Councillor Paula Fletcher":MAILTO:councillor_fletcher@toronto.ca
END:VEVENT
