SUMMARY:Lippert Lane Naming
DESCRIPTION:Lippert Music Centre\, an historic East York music school operating since 1957\, will officially unveil “Lippert Lane\,” the newly named laneway behind the studio on May 24th 2026. The event will feature live music\, refreshments\, and remarks from City Councillor Paula Fletcher and MP Peter Tabuns. This naming recognizes nearly 70 years of contribution to music education and the East York community.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/lippert-lane-naming/
LOCATION:Lippert Music Centre Inc.\, 970 Pape Avenue\, Toronto\, M4K 3V7
ORGANIZER;CN="Charleen Beard":MAILTO:info@lippertmusic.com
END:VEVENT
