SUMMARY:2026 Golden Triangle GIANT Garage Sale
DESCRIPTION:One of East York’s favourite community traditions returns on Saturday\, June 6\, as the Golden Triangle GIANT Garage Sale celebrates its 27th year. \nApproximately 100 households across 13 streets in the Pape & O’Connor area will participate\, creating one of Toronto’s largest neighbourhood garage sales. The event offers a strong visual opportunity\, with busy residential streets\, families participating\, and shoppers searching for second-hand treasures. \nEvent Details\n• Saturday\, June 6\, 2026\n• 8:00 AM – 2:00 PM\n• Golden Triangle neighbourhood\, East York (Pape & O’Connor area) \nHighlights include: \n• Nearly 100 participating homes\n• Interactive Google map for shoppers\n• Salvation Army donation pickup\n• Community participation\, including the Todmorden Royal Canadian Legion
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/2026-golden-triangle-giant-garage-sale/
LOCATION:Golden Triangle neighbourhood in East York\, ON\, Pape & O'Connor\, Toronto\, M4J 2Y7
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/13151021/Blogger-Background-Image-Website.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Lynn Marie Robinson":MAILTO:hello@thelynngroup.ca
END:VEVENT
