SUMMARY:CALL OUT FOR ARTISTS SHOWS IN 2026-2027
DESCRIPTION:Do you have something to say about social justice\, or empowerment\, love\, beauty?\nCan your work be seen by all ages?\nDo you make 2D visual art or photography or digital art or know someone who does?\nMaybe we could work together to show your talents on our walls\nin Neighbourhood Gallery & our Sanctuary! NO fees\, shows run 10-14 weeks long. \nPlease send an artist’s statement about the body of work\,\n& up to 10 jpegs or website link to curator Lauren McKinley Renzetti\nmckinleyrenzetti@gmail.com \nDeadline for submissions- July 31\, 2026. for the Sept 2026-Sept 2027 season.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/call-out-for-artists-shows-in-2026-2027/
LOCATION:Neighbourhood Gallery In Neighbourhood Unitarian Universalist Congregation\, 310 Danforth Avenue\, Toronto\, M4K 1N6
